# The session's environment. uwsm, which starts Hyprland here (the greeter
# prefers its session), sources this before the compositor and hands it to
# systemd as well, so it also reaches what systemd starts rather than Hyprland:
# xdg autostart (Nextcloud), D-Bus activated apps and the portals. Hyprland's
# wiki asks uwsm users to keep toolkit and theming variables here instead of in
# the Hyprland config; modules/env.lua reads this file when uwsm is not in use.
# One `export KEY=value` per line, unquoted.

# Qt apps take their widget style (Kvantum), icon theme and font from qt6ct's
# config, KDE apps their colours from the colour scheme kdeglobals names; wallust
# renders all of them, see .github/THEMING.md.
export QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME=qt6ct
# Hyprland draws the frame, not Qt.
export QT_WAYLAND_DISABLE_WINDOWDECORATION=1
